WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:13.163
<v Host>Welcome to Japanese Daily News. I'm Maya. Today is October twenty-seventh. Asia's big film festival opened in Tokyo, in heavy rain. Let's listen.

00:00:13.763 --> 00:00:16.716
<v News>今日のニュースです。

00:00:17.416 --> 00:00:26.079
<v News>10月26日、東京で「東京国際映画祭」が始まりました。

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:34.148
<v News>この映画祭は、アジアでいちばん大きい映画祭の一つです。

00:00:34.847 --> 00:00:42.167
<v News>今年で39回目で、11月4日まで開かれます。

00:00:42.868 --> 00:00:50.404
<v News>日比谷や銀座などの映画館で、204本の映画が見られます。

00:00:51.103 --> 00:00:57.752
<v News>最初の日の夕方、レッドカーペットのイベントがありました。

00:00:58.451 --> 00:01:07.019
<v News>国内や外国から、およそ270人の俳優や監督が来ました。

00:01:07.719 --> 00:01:12.567
<v News>この日は、強い雨が降っていました。

00:01:13.268 --> 00:01:22.123
<v News>俳優の中島健人さんは、「映画にとっては恵みの雨です」と話しました。

00:01:22.823 --> 00:01:29.927
<v News>最初に上映される映画は、「スキヤキ　上を向いて歩こう」です。

00:01:30.628 --> 00:01:37.659
<v News>有名な歌「上を向いて歩こう」を作った人たちの話です。

00:01:38.359 --> 00:01:40.424
<v Host>Now let's break it down.

00:01:41.024 --> 00:01:50.311
<v Slow>10月26日、東京で「東京国際映画祭」が始まりました。

00:01:51.111 --> 00:01:56.871
<v Host>On October twenty-sixth, the Tokyo International Film Festival started in Tokyo.

00:01:57.471 --> 00:01:59.992
<v Vocab>映画祭

00:02:00.391 --> 00:02:06.391
<v Host>It means a film festival. The first part means movie, and the second part means festival.

00:02:06.992 --> 00:02:09.319
<v Vocab>始まる

00:02:09.719 --> 00:02:12.048
<v Host>It means to start or begin.

00:02:12.647 --> 00:02:20.544
<v Slow>この映画祭は、アジアでいちばん大きい映画祭の一つです。

00:02:21.343 --> 00:02:25.135
<v Host>This festival is one of the biggest film festivals in Asia.

00:02:25.735 --> 00:02:28.135
<v Vocab>大きい

00:02:28.536 --> 00:02:30.407
<v Host>It means big.

00:02:31.008 --> 00:02:38.855
<v Slow>今年で39回目で、11月4日まで開かれます。

00:02:39.656 --> 00:02:44.936
<v Host>This year is the thirty-ninth time, and it will be held until November fourth.

00:02:45.536 --> 00:02:48.848
<v Vocab>39回目

00:02:49.247 --> 00:02:52.536
<v Host>With a number, it means the thirty-ninth time.

00:02:53.135 --> 00:02:55.343
<v Vocab>開く

00:02:55.743 --> 00:03:00.159
<v Host>It means to hold an event. Here it is passive, will be held.

00:03:00.759 --> 00:03:08.824
<v Slow>日比谷や銀座などの映画館で、204本の映画が見られます。

00:03:09.623 --> 00:03:16.271
<v Host>At movie theaters in areas like Hibiya and Ginza, people can see two hundred four films.

00:03:16.872 --> 00:03:19.295
<v Vocab>映画館

00:03:19.695 --> 00:03:21.592
<v Host>It means a movie theater.

00:03:22.192 --> 00:03:24.496
<v Vocab>見られる

00:03:24.895 --> 00:03:27.512
<v Host>It means can see, or can watch.

00:03:28.111 --> 00:03:35.240
<v Slow>最初の日の夕方、レッドカーペットのイベントがありました。

00:03:36.039 --> 00:03:40.216
<v Host>In the evening of the first day, there was a red carpet event.

00:03:40.816 --> 00:03:43.120
<v Vocab>最初

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:46.256
<v Host>It means the first, or the beginning.

00:03:46.855 --> 00:03:49.183
<v Vocab>夕方

00:03:49.584 --> 00:03:52.584
<v Host>It means early evening, around sunset.

00:03:53.183 --> 00:04:02.352
<v Slow>国内や外国から、およそ270人の俳優や監督が来ました。

00:04:03.151 --> 00:04:09.104
<v Host>About two hundred seventy actors and directors came, from Japan and from abroad.

00:04:09.704 --> 00:04:12.104
<v Vocab>外国

00:04:12.503 --> 00:04:15.312
<v Host>It means foreign countries, abroad.

00:04:15.912 --> 00:04:18.288
<v Vocab>俳優

00:04:18.687 --> 00:04:21.088
<v Host>It means an actor or actress.

00:04:21.687 --> 00:04:24.064
<v Vocab>監督

00:04:24.463 --> 00:04:26.384
<v Host>It means a film director.

00:04:26.983 --> 00:04:32.168
<v Slow>この日は、強い雨が降っていました。

00:04:32.968 --> 00:04:35.512
<v Host>On this day, it was raining hard.

00:04:36.112 --> 00:04:38.271
<v Vocab>強い

00:04:38.672 --> 00:04:42.824
<v Host>It means strong. With rain, it means heavy rain.

00:04:43.423 --> 00:04:52.927
<v Slow>俳優の中島健人さんは、「映画にとっては恵みの雨です」と話しました。

00:04:53.728 --> 00:04:58.839
<v Host>Actor Kento Nakajima said, for movies, this is a blessing rain.

00:04:59.439 --> 00:05:02.223
<v Vocab>恵みの雨

00:05:02.624 --> 00:05:06.343
<v Host>It means a blessing rain, rain that brings good things.

00:05:06.944 --> 00:05:14.576
<v Slow>最初に上映される映画は、「スキヤキ　上を向いて歩こう」です。

00:05:15.375 --> 00:05:19.288
<v Host>The first film to be shown is a movie about a famous song.

00:05:19.887 --> 00:05:22.264
<v Vocab>上映

00:05:22.663 --> 00:05:25.112
<v Host>It means showing a film on a screen.

00:05:25.711 --> 00:05:33.271
<v Slow>有名な歌「上を向いて歩こう」を作った人たちの話です。

00:05:34.072 --> 00:05:37.456
<v Host>It is a story about the people who made the famous song.

00:05:38.055 --> 00:05:40.288
<v Vocab>有名

00:05:40.687 --> 00:05:42.560
<v Host>It means famous.

00:05:43.160 --> 00:05:45.103
<v Vocab>歌

00:05:45.504 --> 00:05:47.375
<v Host>It means a song.

00:05:47.975 --> 00:05:50.783
<v Host>Now listen to the full story again.

00:05:51.384 --> 00:05:54.336
<v News>今日のニュースです。

